{"titles": {"CN": "心之絮语", "EN": "Lora's Thoughts", "JP": "ローラーの心の声", "KR": "로라의 마음 속 목소리"}, "regions": {"CN": [{"title": "雨天散步", "scripts": [{"bgm": "qe-ova-3", "bgName": "bg_project_explorer_room1", "say": "外面似乎下雨了……", "actorName": "艾普洛", "nameColor": "#A9F548FF"}, {"say": "雨滴打在植物的叶子上……发出了沙沙的声音……", "actorName": "艾普洛", "nameColor": "#A9F548FF"}, {"say": "很美好呢……", "actorName": "艾普洛", "nameColor": "#A9F548FF"}, {"say": "而且人很少……很适合散步……", "actorName": "艾普洛", "nameColor": "#A9F548FF"}, {"options": [{"content": "当然可以", "flag": 1}, {"content": "等雨停了再去好么", "flag": 2}], "say": "{tb}……可以陪艾普洛一起吗？", "actorName": "艾普洛", "nameColor": "#A9F548FF"}, {"optionFlag": 1, "say": "{tb}也会喜欢这样的环境嘛……", "actorName": "艾普洛", "nameColor": "#A9F548FF"}, {"optionFlag": 1, "say": "艾普洛觉得自己……被理解了呢……！", "actorName": "艾普洛", "nameColor": "#A9F548FF"}, {"optionFlag": 2, "say": "那样的话……感觉街道上会热闹起来呢", "actorName": "艾普洛", "nameColor": "#A9F548FF"}, {"optionFlag": 2, "say": "不过，似乎也不错……？", "actorName": "艾普洛", "nameColor": "#A9F548FF"}]}, {"title": "下午茶时间", "scripts": [{"bgm": "qe-ova-3", "bgName": "bg_project_explorer_room2", "say": "那个，艾普洛试着做了甜点……", "actorName": "艾普洛", "nameColor": "#A9F548FF"}, {"say": "是、是向日葵造型的哦……", "actorName": "艾普洛", "nameColor": "#A9F548FF"}, {"say": "按照食谱上说的，用了蜂蜜和柠檬……", "actorName": "艾普洛", "nameColor": "#A9F548FF"}, {"say": "烤的时候一直担心会烤焦……", "actorName": "艾普洛", "nameColor": "#A9F548FF"}, {"options": [{"content": "造型很可爱，我们一起尝尝", "flag": 1}, {"content": "拿去和大家一起分享吧！", "flag": 2}], "say": "还好最后看起来还不错……！", "actorName": "艾普洛", "nameColor": "#A9F548FF"}, {"optionFlag": 1, "say": "嗯嗯，只要{tb}喜欢就好了……", "actorName": "艾普洛", "nameColor": "#A9F548FF"}, {"optionFlag": 2, "say": "和大家……！艾普洛、这就去准备盘子！", "actorName": "艾普洛", "nameColor": "#A9F548FF"}]}, {"title": "文件整理", "scripts": [{"bgm": "qe-ova-3", "bgName": "bg_project_explorer_room2", "say": "……这份文件，应该放在你的书桌上吗……？", "actorName": "艾普洛", "nameColor": "#A9F548FF"}, {"say": "艾普洛怕放错了地方……", "actorName": "艾普洛", "nameColor": "#A9F548FF"}, {"options": [{"content": "往常也是用日期排列，这次就麻烦你了", "flag": 1}, {"content": "你可以试试用颜色分类，会更高效", "flag": 2}], "say": "还有这份，是不是应该按照日期重新排列一下比较好……", "actorName": "艾普洛", "nameColor": "#A9F548FF"}, {"optionFlag": 1, "say": "嗯，明白了……", "actorName": "艾普洛", "nameColor": "#A9F548FF"}, {"optionFlag": 1, "say": "艾普洛……会继续认真做的。", "actorName": "艾普洛", "nameColor": "#A9F548FF"}, {"optionFlag": 2, "say": "颜色分类……！", "actorName": "艾普洛", "nameColor": "#A9F548FF"}, {"optionFlag": 2, "say": "艾普洛明白了！我会尝试一下的！", "actorName": "艾普洛", "nameColor": "#A9F548FF"}]}, {"title": "挑选礼物", "scripts": [{"bgm": "qe-ova-3", "bgName": "bg_project_explorer_room1", "say": "……那个玩偶……和{tb}好像……", "actorName": "艾普洛", "nameColor": "#A9F548FF"}, {"say": "都带着温暖的笑容……", "actorName": "艾普洛", "nameColor": "#A9F548FF"}, {"options": [{"content": "买一个送给你", "flag": 1}, {"content": "要买一整套搭配么？", "flag": 2}], "say": "看着它就觉得很安心……", "actorName": "艾普洛", "nameColor": "#A9F548FF"}, {"optionFlag": 1, "say": "……可以吗？谢谢你……艾普洛会放在最喜欢的角落~", "actorName": "艾普洛", "nameColor": "#A9F548FF"}, {"optionFlag": 2, "say": "真、真的吗？那还要配一顶可爱的小帽子！", "actorName": "艾普洛", "nameColor": "#A9F548FF"}, {"optionFlag": 2, "say": "唔，好像有一些搭配灵感涌出来了……！", "actorName": "艾普洛", "nameColor": "#A9F548FF"}]}, {"title": "发现新奇事物", "scripts": [{"bgm": "qe-ova-3", "bgName": "bg_project_explorer_room2", "say": "这些自动售货机……会自己出来饮料吗……", "actorName": "艾普洛", "nameColor": "#A9F548FF"}, {"say": "上面有好多按钮，还有闪亮的灯……", "actorName": "艾普洛", "nameColor": "#A9F548FF"}, {"options": [{"content": "想试试么？我教你。", "flag": 1}, {"content": "每个按钮都按一次吧！", "flag": 2}], "say": "是、是要这样操作吗？", "actorName": "艾普洛", "nameColor": "#A9F548FF"}, {"optionFlag": 1, "say": "哇……好、好厉害，饮料真的出来了……", "actorName": "艾普洛", "nameColor": "#A9F548FF"}, {"optionFlag": 1, "say": "艾普洛会努力学习的！", "actorName": "艾普洛", "nameColor": "#A9F548FF"}, {"optionFlag": 2, "say": "随便按吗……", "actorName": "艾普洛", "nameColor": "#A9F548FF"}, {"optionFlag": 2, "say": "这样的话……艾普洛就能尝到所有味道了……！", "actorName": "艾普洛", "nameColor": "#A9F548FF"}]}, {"title": "纪念册制作", "scripts": [{"bgm": "qe-ova-13", "bgName": "bg_project_explorer_room3", "say": "{tb}~我把我们一起生活期间拍摄的照片都收集起来了！", "actorName": "艾普洛", "nameColor": "#A9F548FF"}, {"say": "还贴了贴纸和丝带呢！", "actorName": "艾普洛", "nameColor": "#A9F548FF"}, {"say": "请看，这张是一起去海边的时候，另外一张是我们共进下午茶的纪念……", "actorName": "艾普洛", "nameColor": "#A9F548FF"}, {"say": "每张照片的旁边，我都记录了那时的心情哦！", "actorName": "艾普洛", "nameColor": "#A9F548FF"}, {"options": [{"content": "很可爱", "flag": 2}, {"content": "很有条理", "flag": 1}], "say": "你觉得怎么样？", "actorName": "艾普洛", "nameColor": "#A9F548FF"}, {"optionFlag": 2, "say": "嘿嘿，我还要再多贴一些可爱的剪贴画！", "actorName": "艾普洛", "nameColor": "#A9F548FF"}, {"optionFlag": 1, "say": "静下心来，慢慢整理的过程，也让我觉得很开心呢！", "actorName": "艾普洛", "nameColor": "#A9F548FF"}]}, {"title": "仓库寻宝", "scripts": [{"bgm": "qe-ova-4", "bgName": "bg_project_explorer_room3", "say": "咦？仓库最里面的架子上……有好多没见过的东西呢。", "actorName": "艾普洛", "nameColor": "#A9F548FF"}, {"say": "亮晶晶的航海罗盘，还有彩色的玻璃珠……看起来都很可爱。", "actorName": "艾普洛", "nameColor": "#A9F548FF"}, {"say": "欸？角落里的那个是……", "actorName": "艾普洛", "nameColor": "#A9F548FF"}, {"say": "{tb}，我们一起来好好整理一下这里好不好？", "actorName": "艾普洛", "nameColor": "#A9F548FF"}, {"options": [{"content": "好啊，一起整理吧", "flag": 2}, {"content": "我的秘密绝对不能被发现", "flag": 1}], "say": "说不定还能发现被你藏起来的秘密哦！", "actorName": "艾普洛", "nameColor": "#A9F548FF"}, {"optionFlag": 2, "say": "好耶！仓库寻宝任务——启动！", "actorName": "艾普洛", "nameColor": "#A9F548FF"}, {"optionFlag": 1, "say": "嗯……？{tb}真的有不能被发现的秘密吗？！", "actorName": "艾普洛", "nameColor": "#A9F548FF"}, {"optionFlag": 1, "say": "好、好吧，那就只好放过你啦……", "actorName": "艾普洛", "nameColor": "#A9F548FF"}]}, {"title": "健康监督", "scripts": [{"bgm": "qe-ova-13", "bgName": "bg_project_explorer_room3", "say": "{tb}，你今天已经连续工作三小时了……", "actorName": "艾普洛", "nameColor": "#A9F548FF"}, {"say": "我泡了茉莉花茶，还准备了维生素软糖。", "actorName": "艾普洛", "nameColor": "#A9F548FF"}, {"options": [{"content": "遵命", "flag": 2}, {"content": "再工作一会儿就来", "flag": 1}], "say": "现在请闭上眼睛休息五分钟，这是命令哦！", "actorName": "艾普洛", "nameColor": "#A9F548FF"}, {"optionFlag": 2, "say": "嘿嘿，照顾{tb}也是我的重要职责哦！", "actorName": "艾普洛", "nameColor": "#A9F548FF"}, {"optionFlag": 1, "say": "可是，你的健康更重要啊……", "actorName": "艾普洛", "nameColor": "#A9F548FF"}, {"optionFlag": 1, "say": "那、那至少让我帮你一起整理文件吧……！", "actorName": "艾普洛", "nameColor": "#A9F548FF"}]}, {"title": "装饰计划", "scripts": [{"bgm": "qe-ova-13", "bgName": "bg_project_explorer_room3", "say": "{tb}！我发现了超棒的装饰材料！", "actorName": "艾普洛", "nameColor": "#A9F548FF"}, {"say": "金色和橙色的丝带，可以把会议室变得像向日葵花田一样明亮~", "actorName": "艾普洛", "nameColor": "#A9F548FF"}, {"say": "我们还可以折一些彩色千纸鹤挂在窗边~", "actorName": "艾普洛", "nameColor": "#A9F548FF"}, {"options": [{"content": "听起来很棒，需要我帮忙么？", "flag": 2}, {"content": "会不会太显眼了？", "flag": 1}], "say": "你觉得这个主意可行嘛？", "actorName": "艾普洛", "nameColor": "#A9F548FF"}, {"optionFlag": 2, "say": "当然当然！欢迎加入家装改造小队~", "actorName": "艾普洛", "nameColor": "#A9F548FF"}, {"optionFlag": 2, "say": "和我一起做设计，让能见到的每个角落都充满阳光吧！", "actorName": "艾普洛", "nameColor": "#A9F548FF"}, {"optionFlag": 1, "say": "欸，你觉得太显眼了吗？", "actorName": "艾普洛", "nameColor": "#A9F548FF"}, {"optionFlag": 1, "say": "那……只在窗台放一束向日葵如何呢？", "actorName": "艾普洛", "nameColor": "#A9F548FF"}]}], "EN": [{"title": "Walk on a Rainy Day", "scripts": [{"bgm": "qe-ova-3", "bgName": "bg_project_explorer_room1", "say": "It looks like it's going to start raining...", "actorName": "Lora", "nameColor": "#A9F548FF"}, {"say": "There's at least one thing I do like about rain...", "actorName": "Lora", "nameColor": "#A9F548FF"}, {"say": "It's the sound of the raindrops hitting the leaves, making that nice rustling sound...", "actorName": "Lora", "nameColor": "#A9F548FF"}, {"say": "Also, there are hardly any people out when it rains... It's perfect for a walk...", "actorName": "Lora", "nameColor": "#A9F548FF"}, {"options": [{"content": "Sure thing.", "flag": 1}, {"content": "Let's wait until the rain stops.", "flag": 2}], "say": "{tb}, would you like to go for a stroll with me?", "actorName": "Lora", "nameColor": "#A9F548FF"}, {"optionFlag": 1, "say": "You must like the rainy atmosphere, too...", "actorName": "Lora", "nameColor": "#A9F548FF"}, {"optionFlag": 1, "say": "It makes me feel like you really understand me... Heehee...", "actorName": "Lora", "nameColor": "#A9F548FF"}, {"optionFlag": 2, "say": "But then... the streets will be full of people, unlike now...", "actorName": "Lora", "nameColor": "#A9F548FF"}, {"optionFlag": 2, "say": "Although... I guess maybe that's not so bad...", "actorName": "Lora", "nameColor": "#A9F548FF"}]}, {"title": "Afternoon Tea", "scripts": [{"bgm": "qe-ova-3", "bgName": "bg_project_explorer_room2", "say": "So, um, I baked some cookies...", "actorName": "Lora", "nameColor": "#A9F548FF"}, {"say": "I-I made them in the shape of sunflowers...", "actorName": "Lora", "nameColor": "#A9F548FF"}, {"say": "As the recipe said, I also added some honey and lemon juice...", "actorName": "Lora", "nameColor": "#A9F548FF"}, {"say": "I was worried the whole time while they were baking... I thought they might burn...", "actorName": "Lora", "nameColor": "#A9F548FF"}, {"options": [{"content": "They look adorable. Let's dig in.", "flag": 1}, {"content": "We should share these with some friends!", "flag": 2}], "say": "Luckily... they came out pretty well!", "actorName": "Lora", "nameColor": "#A9F548FF"}, {"optionFlag": 1, "say": "S-sure! As long as you like them, I'm happy... Heehee...", "actorName": "Lora", "nameColor": "#A9F548FF"}, {"optionFlag": 2, "say": "Sh-sharing with friends... Okay! I'll go and get a plate!", "actorName": "Lora", "nameColor": "#A9F548FF"}]}, {"title": "Filing Paperwork", "scripts": [{"bgm": "qe-ova-3", "bgName": "bg_project_explorer_room2", "say": "Where should I leave these documents? On the desk?", "actorName": "Lora", "nameColor": "#A9F548FF"}, {"say": "I'm just worried I'll put them in the wrong place...", "actorName": "Lora", "nameColor": "#A9F548FF"}, {"options": [{"content": "That'd be great. Sort by date, please.", "flag": 1}, {"content": "Sort them by color. It'll be more efficient.", "flag": 2}], "say": "Also... maybe I should reorganize them according to date...", "actorName": "Lora", "nameColor": "#A9F548FF"}, {"optionFlag": 1, "say": "Alright, then...", "actorName": "Lora", "nameColor": "#A9F548FF"}, {"optionFlag": 1, "say": "I'll, um... keep at it!", "actorName": "Lora", "nameColor": "#A9F548FF"}, {"optionFlag": 2, "say": "B-by color...", "actorName": "Lora", "nameColor": "#A9F548FF"}, {"optionFlag": 2, "say": "Okay! I'll see what I can do!", "actorName": "Lora", "nameColor": "#A9F548FF"}]}, {"title": "Choosing a Gift", "scripts": [{"bgm": "qe-ova-3", "bgName": "bg_project_explorer_room1", "say": "That plushie kind of reminds me of you, {tb}...", "actorName": "Lora", "nameColor": "#A9F548FF"}, {"say": "You both have such warm smiles...", "actorName": "Lora", "nameColor": "#A9F548FF"}, {"options": [{"content": "I'll buy it for you, then.", "flag": 1}, {"content": "Should we get some accessories for it as well?", "flag": 2}], "say": "Just looking at it makes me feel at ease...", "actorName": "Lora", "nameColor": "#A9F548FF"}, {"optionFlag": 1, "say": "You will? Thank you so much... I'll put it in my favorite corner!", "actorName": "Lora", "nameColor": "#A9F548FF"}, {"optionFlag": 2, "say": "A-accessories? You mean it? Okay, then I want to give it a cute hat as well!", "actorName": "Lora", "nameColor": "#A9F548FF"}, {"optionFlag": 2, "say": "Heheh... Now I'm getting all sorts of ideas for how to dress it up...", "actorName": "Lora", "nameColor": "#A9F548FF"}]}, {"title": "Curiosity", "scripts": [{"bgm": "qe-ova-3", "bgName": "bg_project_explorer_room2", "say": "Do these vending machines... just dispense drinks by themselves?", "actorName": "Lora", "nameColor": "#A9F548FF"}, {"say": "Look at all those buttons and glowing lights they have...", "actorName": "Lora", "nameColor": "#A9F548FF"}, {"options": [{"content": "You wanna try it? Let me show you how.", "flag": 1}, {"content": "We should push ALL the buttons!", "flag": 2}], "say": "Um, i-is this how you're supposed to do it?", "actorName": "Lora", "nameColor": "#A9F548FF"}, {"optionFlag": 1, "say": "Whoa... I can't believe it... It really dispensed a drink...", "actorName": "Lora", "nameColor": "#A9F548FF"}, {"optionFlag": 1, "say": "I'll really try to memorize how it's done!", "actorName": "Lora", "nameColor": "#A9F548FF"}, {"optionFlag": 2, "say": "J-just push them... randomly?", "actorName": "Lora", "nameColor": "#A9F548FF"}, {"optionFlag": 2, "say": "I suppose if we do that... I can try ALL the drinks as well!", "actorName": "Lora", "nameColor": "#A9F548FF"}]}, {"title": "Making an Album", "scripts": [{"bgm": "qe-ova-13", "bgName": "bg_project_explorer_room3", "say": "{tb}! I made an album of all the photos we've taken together!", "actorName": "Lora", "nameColor": "#A9F548FF"}, {"say": "I even put little stickers and ribbons on it!", "actorName": "Lora", "nameColor": "#A9F548FF"}, {"say": "Here, look! This is the time we went to the beach, and this is when we had tea together...", "actorName": "Lora", "nameColor": "#A9F548FF"}, {"say": "I also wrote about what I felt at the time next to each photo!", "actorName": "Lora", "nameColor": "#A9F548FF"}, {"options": [{"content": "It looks adorable.", "flag": 2}, {"content": "It's really orderly.", "flag": 1}], "say": "What do you think?", "actorName": "Lora", "nameColor": "#A9F548FF"}, {"optionFlag": 2, "say": "Heehee! I think I'll give it even more cute decorations!", "actorName": "Lora", "nameColor": "#A9F548FF"}, {"optionFlag": 1, "say": "Mhm! It's nice to slow down and carefully organize things. It puts me in a good mood!", "actorName": "Lora", "nameColor": "#A9F548FF"}]}, {"title": "Treasure Hunting in the Storehouse", "scripts": [{"bgm": "qe-ova-4", "bgName": "bg_project_explorer_room3", "say": "Hm? Over there, on the shelf furthest back in the storehouse... There's so much stuff I've never seen before.", "actorName": "Lora", "nameColor": "#A9F548FF"}, {"say": "There's a shiny compass, a jar of marbles in every color... They look so cute.", "actorName": "Lora", "nameColor": "#A9F548FF"}, {"say": "Wait... What's that in the corner?", "actorName": "Lora", "nameColor": "#A9F548FF"}, {"say": "{tb}, how about we tidy up this place together?", "actorName": "Lora", "nameColor": "#A9F548FF"}, {"options": [{"content": "Sounds good. Let's do it.", "flag": 2}, {"content": "I'd rather you don't uncover my secrets.", "flag": 1}], "say": "Who knows – we might find some lost treasure in here!", "actorName": "Lora", "nameColor": "#A9F548FF"}, {"optionFlag": 2, "say": "Sweet! It's time for a treasure hunt!", "actorName": "Lora", "nameColor": "#A9F548FF"}, {"optionFlag": 1, "say": "What? There's really secrets in here that you don't want to come to light?!", "actorName": "Lora", "nameColor": "#A9F548FF"}, {"optionFlag": 1, "say": "Well, okay... I'll leave it be.", "actorName": "Lora", "nameColor": "#A9F548FF"}]}, {"title": "Managing Your Health", "scripts": [{"bgm": "qe-ova-13", "bgName": "bg_project_explorer_room3", "say": "{tb}, you've been working nonstop for three hours now...", "actorName": "Lora", "nameColor": "#A9F548FF"}, {"say": "I've made jasmine tea and gotten you some vitamin gummies.", "actorName": "Lora", "nameColor": "#A9F548FF"}, {"options": [{"content": "Yes, ma'am.", "flag": 2}, {"content": "Give me just a little longer.", "flag": 1}], "say": "Close your eyes and get a five-minute break now. That's an order!", "actorName": "Lora", "nameColor": "#A9F548FF"}, {"optionFlag": 2, "say": "Heehee. Looking after you is another one of my important duties!", "actorName": "Lora", "nameColor": "#A9F548FF"}, {"optionFlag": 1, "say": "But... your health is more important.", "actorName": "Lora", "nameColor": "#A9F548FF"}, {"optionFlag": 1, "say": "I-if you won't stop, then at least let me help you sort your paperwork!", "actorName": "Lora", "nameColor": "#A9F548FF"}]}, {"title": "Decoration Plan", "scripts": [{"bgm": "qe-ova-13", "bgName": "bg_project_explorer_room3", "say": "{tb}! I found some amazing decorative material!", "actorName": "Lora", "nameColor": "#A9F548FF"}, {"say": "Using these gold and orange ribbons, we can make your meeting room look like a bright sunflower patch!", "actorName": "Lora", "nameColor": "#A9F548FF"}, {"say": "Also, we can make some colorful paper cranes and put them by the window! I think that'd look great.", "actorName": "Lora", "nameColor": "#A9F548FF"}, {"options": [{"content": "Good idea. Want me to help?", "flag": 2}, {"content": "Might be a little too flashy, you know?", "flag": 1}], "say": "What do you think?", "actorName": "Lora", "nameColor": "#A9F548FF"}, {"optionFlag": 2, "say": "Thank you! Heehee – welcome to the home renovation team!", "actorName": "Lora", "nameColor": "#A9F548FF"}, {"optionFlag": 2, "say": "Together, we'll fill every corner of this place with warmth and sunshine!", "actorName": "Lora", "nameColor": "#A9F548FF"}, {"optionFlag": 1, "say": "Huh? Is that... a problem?", "actorName": "Lora", "nameColor": "#A9F548FF"}, {"optionFlag": 1, "say": "Then... how about placing just a single sunflower by the window?", "actorName": "Lora", "nameColor": "#A9F548FF"}]}], "JP": [{"title": "雨の日のお散歩", "scripts": [{"bgm": "qe-ova-3", "bgName": "bg_project_explorer_room1", "say": "雨が降り出したみたいです……", "actorName": "ローラー", "nameColor": "#A9F548FF"}, {"say": "雨粒が葉っぱを叩いて……ポツポツと心地よい音が響いていて……", "actorName": "ローラー", "nameColor": "#A9F548FF"}, {"say": "なんだか……素敵ですね……", "actorName": "ローラー", "nameColor": "#A9F548FF"}, {"say": "それにひとけもなくひっそりしていて……お散歩にぴったり……", "actorName": "ローラー", "nameColor": "#A9F548FF"}, {"options": [{"content": "もちろん", "flag": 1}, {"content": "雨が止んでからにしようか", "flag": 2}], "say": "よかったらローラーと一緒にお散歩しませんか？", "actorName": "ローラー", "nameColor": "#A9F548FF"}, {"optionFlag": 1, "say": "{tb}も、こういう雰囲気が好きなんですね……", "actorName": "ローラー", "nameColor": "#A9F548FF"}, {"optionFlag": 1, "say": "ローラー、なんだか…わかってもらえた気がして……えへへ……", "actorName": "ローラー", "nameColor": "#A9F548FF"}, {"optionFlag": 2, "say": "そうなると……街は今と違って、賑やかな雰囲気に……", "actorName